# Deployable paths: a commit touching one of these (and not only a `!`
# exclusion) is deployed by the next deploy.yml run (block-eden-mono w1/m25).
# deploy.yml's gate deploys when such a commit landed after the production
# pin's producer and that pin is at least 6 hours old; scripts/deploy_latency.py
# measures how long one has waited. One git glob per line; `!` excludes.
lego/**
# The CLI (lego/cli/) ships as user-installed binaries via the bex-cli/v* tag
# train (cli-release.yml), not via the platform image: its commits must not
# trigger a production platform redeploy.
!lego/cli/**
dashboard/**
deploy/opensandbox/**
deploy/gitops/**
.github/workflows/deploy.yml
# The build installs Syft from it for the SBOMs.
scripts/install-syft.py
# The test suites run on every push touching their own paths, so a change only
# to a suite, its workflow or the scripts it tests deploys nothing.
